      "i": 13,
      "lines": [
        36,
        41
      ],
      "raw": "* **Search Condition**: Choose **AND** or **OR**.\n\n  | **Entity**  | **Search Condition Options** | **Usage**                                                                                                                                             |\n  | ----------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n  | Transaction | AND only                     | Combine fields (e.g., bill number **AND** bill date). You can mark fields as mandatory.                                                               |\n  | Customer    | AND OR                       | **AND**: Combination searches like first name **AND** last name. <br />**OR**: Partial searches like the first few letters of a name or phone number. |",
      "kind": "list",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "Search Condition: Choose AND or OR.EntitySearch Condition OptionsUsageTransactionAND onlyCombine fields (e.g., bill number AND bill date). You can mark fields as mandatory.CustomerAND ORAND: Combination searches like first name AND last name. OR: Partial searches like the first few letters of a name or phone number.",
      "attrs": {
        "ordered": "false"
      },
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "transform",
